SUMMARY:The Hmm @ Brainwash Festival
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
DTSTART:20261031T180000Z
DTEND:20261031T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:The Hmm presents AI\, AI\, AI @ Brainwash festival\nWe use algo
 rithms\, platforms and AI-driven tools every day\, often without really un
 derstanding what’s happening behind the screen. The Hmm’s educational
  programme\, ‘ai\, ai\, ai’\, turns these invisible systems into somet
 hing you can see\, understand\, question and play with. During Brainwash f
 estival we’re launching our latest workshops—not involving AI\, but ab
 out AI—specially designed for children aged 8 and over\, and their paren
 ts. You can experience ‘Make your own Slopject’ and ‘Squish the Syst
 em’ at Brainwash festival Ijzaal. \nMake your own Slopject\nDo you ever
  stop to think that everything you do online is being tracked? Every ‘li
 ke’\, every scroll and every second you spend watching a video tells us
  something about you. All those little bits of information together are wh
 at we call data. Algorithms use that data to try and predict what you like
 \, so you see more of that sort of content and adverts. Handy\, perhaps\,
  but is it actually always fair? \nIn the ‘Make your own Slopject’ wor
 kshop\, you’ll step into the role of an algorithm yourself. In exchange
  for handing over your own data\, you’ll receive a token with which you
  can draw (or ‘buy’) another person’s data profile from the ball mac
 hine. What does this person watch? What music do they listen to? What do t
 hey search for online? Afterwards\, you’ll design (or mould) a collectab
 le figurine that you’re almost certain the person behind the data profil
 e would want to buy. \nSquish the System: from facts to vibes\nFor a long
  time\, the rule was: if there’s a photo of it\, it must have happened.
  We now live in an age where any photo could just as easily have been crea
 ted by AI. Every day we’re inundated with photos\, videos and memes\, no
 t intended to tell a story\, but to make you feel something: curious\, res
 tless\, in love with a product. Enough to keep you looking\, clicking\, bu
 ying something. It’s not just people watching. Algorithms are squishing
  the world around us into categories they can understand. \nImages\, there
 fore\, refer less and less to anything\, and increasingly demand something
  from us. A squishy is the perfect object to explore this. It isn’t made
  to be looked at\, but to do something with: grab it\, squeeze it\, be una
 ble to let it go. Just like the images around us. \nIn this workshop\, you
 ’re not a consumer of images\, but a creator. You’ll design your own p
 aper squishy with a mission: an object that says nothing\, but triggers a
  specific sensation. How do you make it go viral? Which aesthetic works fo
 r that\, and with which target audience? And what does it need to look lik
 e to achieve that? \nAbout The Hmm\nThe Hmm is a platform for internet cul
 tures. We explore and celebrate the creativity that arises from virtual in
 teractions and the interplay with the technologies that make them possible
 . Through accessible events\, research\, exhibitions and educational progr
 ammes\, we offer a curious audience playful and engaging insights into onl
 ine life. The workshops ‘Make your own Slopject’ and ‘Squish the Sys
 tem: from facts to vibes’ have been developed in collaboration with arti
 st Maria Mombers\, who is also one of The Hmm’s tutors. \nAbout Brainwas
 h Festival \nBrainwash Festival is the place to be for thought-provoking i
 deas and visions of the future. At Brainwash Festival\, philosophers\, sci
 entists\, artists and writers come together to explore the big questions o
 f our time and challenge the status quo. We bring together established fig
 ures and new voices. We celebrate thinking\, doubt and your curiosity. \nB
 rainwash Festival 2026 takes up the theme ‘the shape of us’\, through
  which it explores\, from different perspectives\, what it means to live t
 ogether. \nMore information about the programme TBA. \n📅 Date: 31 Octob
 er\n📍 Tolhuistuin\n⏱️19:10h – 20:10h: Make your Own Slopject\n⏱
 ️ 20:30h – 21:30h: Squish the System \n🎟️ Tickets: via Brainwash\
 n♿ Accessibility notes\nFind more info on the Tolhuistuin website.
URL:https://thehmm.nl/event/the-hmm-brainwash-festival/
CATEGORIES:The Hmm
END:VEVENT
