SUMMARY:QUACK Community hang-out
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
DTSTART:20261101T110000Z
DTEND:20261101T110000Z
DESCRIPTION:Our community gatherings are for everyone who experiences ablei
 sm\, including (but not limited to) neurodiverse\, disabled\, chronically
  ill and mad people. Have you diagnosed yourself? You are welcome! Not sur
 e if you are disabled\, neurodiverse (etc.) enough for this gathering? You
  are also more than welcome! During this gathering it is encouraged to\; s
 tim\, fidget\, stand up\, lie down\, take a break by yourself if necessary
 . We have a collective responsibility to ensure that the needs of the part
 icipants are met during the meet up! This means that you make your own nee
 ds known and that you check with others if their needs are being met. The
  meeting will primarily be in English\, Dutch is also spoken. There will b
 e vegan food\, coffee and tea\, but feel free to bring your own snacks. GE
 NERAL INFO - Date & Time: - Price: free - Location: Budapest\, Pesthuislaa
 n\, Amsterdam. (Message us if you need help finding it!) COVID/VIRUS SAFET
 Y - Please test beforehand. Tests and masks also available at the entrance
 . - Please mask inside if your bodymind permits it - Please stay home if y
 ou experience symptoms (cold\, or flu symptoms or any other symptoms linke
 d to covid) ACCESSIBILITY All access info are in pinned post! Feel free to
  message us if you have a question!
LOCATION:Amsterdam Nederland\, The Budapest Pesthuislaan  Amsterdam Netherl
 ands
URL:https://radar.squat.net/en/event/amsterdam/quack-queers-undoing-ableism
 -care-kollective/2026-11-01/quack-community-hang-out
CATEGORIES:advice/help/office hours\,disability
END:VEVENT
